<http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#mass_fraction_of_nitric_acid_trihydrate_ambient_aerosol_in_air> a <http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/qu/dim#Dimensionless> ;
