<http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#mole_concentration_of_miscellaneous_phytoplankton_expressed_as_carbon_in_sea_water> a <http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/qu/dim#Concentration> ;
