<http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#tendency_of_atmosphere_mass_content_of_alpha_hexachlorocyclohexane_due_to_dry_deposition> a <http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/qu/dim#MassPerTimePerArea> ;
