<http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/cf/cf-property#tendency_of_atmosphere_moles_of_biogenic_nmvoc_expressed_as_carbon> a <http://purl.oclc.org/NET/ssnx/qu/dim#MolarFlux> ;
